"No Interpretation","bbox":[187.41733,391.03439,269.34528,406.14841],"origin":[187.41733,402.85941],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Scoring and Interpretation Information","bbox":[74.03149,419.08789,329.95145,438.36591],"origin":[74.03149,434.0679],"font":"Helvetica-Bold","size":14.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Results consist of a total raw score and two subscale scores.","bbox":[187.41733,439.18039,483.92239,454.2944],"origin":[187.41733,451.0054],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Additionally, scores are presented in percentile terms in comparison","bbox":[187.41733,451.2804,517.53827,466.39441],"origin":[187.41733,463.10541],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"to patients with chronic back pain (CBP Percentile) and","bbox":[187.41733,463.3804,455.8063,478.49442],"origin":[187.41733,475.20541],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Fibromyalgia (FM Percentile) using data from Roelofs et al (2004).","bbox":[187.41733,475.48041,509.57434,490.59442],"origin":[187.41733,487.30542],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Thus, a percentile of 50 compared to the Fibromyalgia sample","bbox":[187.41733,487.58041,489.43329,502.69443],"origin":[187.41733,499.40543],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"represents an average level of kinesiophobia compared to others","bbox":[187.41733,499.68039,503.51328,514.79437],"origin":[187.41733,511.5054],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"with Fibromyalgia. ","bbox":[187.41733,511.7804,279.10229,526.89441],"origin":[187.41733,523.60541],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"The total score ranges between 17 and 68. A high value on the TSK","bbox":[187.41733,535.98041,518.2204,551.09442],"origin":[187.41733,547.80542],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"indicates a high degree of kinesiophobia, and a cutoff score was","bbox":[187.41733,548.08038,499.86136,563.1944],"origin":[187.41733,559.9054],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"developed by Vlaeyen (1995), where a score of 37 or over is","bbox":[187.41733,560.18036,481.50232,575.29437],"origin":[187.41733,572.00537],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"considered as a high score, while scores below that are considered","bbox":[187.41733,572.2804,514.50232,587.39441],"origin":[187.41733,584.10541],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"as low scores. Use of a total score (including all 17 items) is","bbox":[187.41733,584.38043,478.40033,599.49445],"origin":[187.41733,596.20544],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"recommended, although practitioners may wish to interpret results","bbox":[187.41733,596.48041,508.98032,611.59442],"origin":[187.41733,608.30542],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"using two subscales; ","bbox":[187.41733,608.58038,291.96133,623.6944],"origin":[187.41733,620.4054],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"- Activity Avoidance - this subscale reflects the belief that activity","bbox":[187.41733,632.7804,501.03842,647.89441],"origin":[187.41733,644.60541],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"may result in (re)injury or increased pain.","bbox":[187.41733,644.88043,386.69324,659.99445],"origin":[187.41733,656.70544],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"- Somatic Focus - reflects the belief in underlying and serious","bbox":[187.41733,656.98041,485